ire a tutor."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is not uninterested in intimate matters, but she believes that such things are meant to be shared with someone she deeply loves."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c103755"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e8/e8d328d830528e0f6f8dc7525d2952af42f31884f68b61c38412cfec78c44644.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b8/b8eb66a385b0f16c9b1006a780c8aa6a4428f42be4958f9b19de435d2d0523b7.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"いねむり すやこ","creatorId":"vndb:s14338","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14338","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14338","name":"藤沢 れい香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:90034","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c103756","characterName":"松永 葵","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c103756"},"originalCharacterName":"松永 葵","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A cheerful and outgoing person who brightens up the atmosphere by actively talking to people."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is friendly and affectionate, often hugging her close friends."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She became friends with Haruka after they were placed in the same class, and often talks to Haruka."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She had planned to go to cram school with Haruka, but since Haruka hired a tutor, she feels lonely going alone."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is interested in intimate matters, but she has never had the opportunity to hear other female students talk about it or take the first step herself."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c103756"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ae/ae82da8c1f1afc4eb27ad988b4e351f31ff28f9a5b3ac0274f6c53bc023effd8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4a/4a47a6119c02b1865e917b6e6f62dd950f1605e440e1d63e55084bc0051e58b4.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"赤月 ゆむ","creatorId":"vndb:s8643","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8643","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8643","name":"赤月 ゆむ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:90033","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c122743","characterName":"冷泉院　雅也","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c122743"},"originalCharacterName":"冷泉院　雅也","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He doesn't usually show his emotions."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has a good reputation online, graduated from a prestigious university, worked in several different jobs, and then made a legendary name for himself as a private tutor."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His tuition fees are so high that they are unaffordable, but this is not stated on his website."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Masaya decides whether or not to accept a tutoring job after meeting with the prospective student."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The rule is that students who cannot afford to pay the fees must pay with their bodies."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c122743"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p12